      "content": "i see what u mean about the tone being more polished in A. but i'm curious—if the actual content of the person's achievements and experience is identical, why does the way they talk change how we perceive their actual competence or ability to lead? like, does the grammar in option B actually correlate to how smart or capable they are, or is it just a stylistic thing?",
